#84001
"A Charred and Frozen Forest"
"As you enter, it is clearly evident that a fire has recently stopped burning
here.  The smell of freshly burnt wood fills the area and warm ashes cover the
ground.  The sea to the west is calm, and below you the sounds of crashing
water can softly be heard.  A charred rockface towers above you to the east
with a ten degree slant.
"
"[Altimeas] No Mob
[Altimeas] Begin Major Hydra Area
