still in good condidtion.  Out to the west the Great Sea streches out as far
as the eye can see until it meets the sky on the horizon.  The cliff steadily
declines to the north while to the west lies more barren wasteland.
"
"[Altimeas] Northern Sea to the West
[Xami] stone wall south (city wall)
