#84025
"A Charred and Frozen Forest"
"There is a coldness here that chills you to the bones.  The giant block of ice
to the north emits an aura of freezing air, keeping it from melting.  To the
south a is large stone wall that looks to be as old as time itself.  Although
heavily damaged, the wall seems perfectly stable and able to hold its
position.  With the north and south blocked off, you can either head west to
the faint sound of water or east toward a very faint orangish glow.
"
"[Xami] ice wall to the north
[Xami] stone wall south (city wall)
[Xami] \"a very faint orangish glow.\" becomes \"Darkness\" when final part open.
