"A Charred and Frozen Forest"
"The large ice wall to the south glows orange-red filling the area with an
eerie light.  A large stone wall can be seen to the south west standing tall,
like a city wall perhaps.  To the east, what looks to be a giant rib cage is
half buried and forms bars as if you were looking out through the cell door of
a jail.  As a small wind picks up a notch, a vial stench follows it in from
the north.
"
